  "id": "bb47c68c-a758-4c0b-b60b-0aba5a4de792",
  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge combines multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet to enhance 3DGS driving simulations, while the 4D radar-camera framework improves full-scene perception. Both methods address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging. ReSplat introduces a recurrent Gaussian splatting model that iteratively refines 3D Gaussians without explicit gradients, achieving state-of-the-art performance.",
